post.description:
Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for PhoneKit. This is a **streamable-HTTP** MCP endpoint (JSON-RPC 2.0 over POST, stateless JSON responses) that exposes every endpoint of this API as an MCP tool, so AI agents such as Claude Desktop, Cursor, Windsurf or any MCP client can call it directly.

- `initialize`, `tools/list` and `ping` work for discovery.
- `tools/call` runs the underlying endpoint and is billed exactly like a normal request on your RapidAPI plan.
- Tool inputs mirror the query parameters and body fields documented on each endpoint.

**Endpoint:** `https://phonekit-phone-number-validation-carrier-line-type.p.rapidapi.com/mcp` with headers `X-RapidAPI-Key: YOUR_RAPIDAPI_KEY` and `X-RapidAPI-Host: phonekit-phone-number-validation-carrier-line-type.p.rapidapi.com`.

**Cursor** (`~/.cursor/mcp.json`) or any client that supports remote servers with headers:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "phonekit": {
      "url": "https://phonekit-phone-number-validation-carrier-line-type.p.rapidapi.com/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "X-RapidAPI-Key": "YOUR_RAPIDAPI_KEY",
        "X-RapidAPI-Host": "phonekit-phone-number-validation-carrier-line-type.p.rapidapi.com"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**Claude Desktop** (`claude_desktop_config.json`, via the `mcp-remote` bridge):

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "phonekit": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "mcp-remote",
        "https://phonekit-phone-number-validation-carrier-line-type.p.rapidapi.com/mcp",
        "--header",
        "X-RapidAPI-Key:${RAPIDAPI_KEY}",
        "--header",
        "X-RapidAPI-Host:phonekit-phone-number-validation-carrier-line-type.p.rapidapi.com"
      ],
      "env": {
        "RAPIDAPI_KEY": "YOUR_RAPIDAPI_KEY"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**Raw request:**

```bash
curl -X POST 'https://phonekit-phone-number-validation-carrier-line-type.p.rapidapi.com/mcp' \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -H 'X-RapidAPI-Key: YOUR_RAPIDAPI_KEY' \
  -H 'X-RapidAPI-Host: phonekit-phone-number-validation-carrier-line-type.p.rapidapi.com' \
  -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"tools/list"}'
```
